      "writtenOn": "2022-01-28T14:48:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I found this in code examples in PM0214 4.6.7 Enabling and clearing FPU exception interrupts https://www.st.com/resource/en/programming_manual/pm0214-stm32-cortexm4-mcus-and-mpus-programming-manual-stmicroelectronics.pdf. To be honest I don\u0027t know why it is necessary. Should I mention that data memory buffer was used in examples?",
      "parentUuid": "e17a41c3_5c0386ab",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 114,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 114,
        "endChar": 21
      },
      "revId": "c5e21a86ffd8c8e29dfb24ba88581c23acdd2f15",
